## Future Branch Warnings

### Config override expansion

Do not add these to `configOverride` casually:

```text
runtime
sessions
stream
model
modelLoad.baseModel
context.creationRetry
```

`context.creationRetry` in particular requires changing probe-decision logic in `inference.mjs`.

### Worker operation serialization

Context retry does not solve worker-level native operation serialization or native cancellation. If this becomes a concern, make it a separate branch:

```text
worker operation serialization / native-operation cancellation boundary
```

### Drain shutdown

Shutdown remains abort-only and terminal/off. Drain and drain-with-timeout remain future work.

### Cleanup and optimization

Keep cleanup and optimization as separate approved passes. Do not mix them with feature work.

### GPU probing

Hardware probing remains CPU/RAM-oriented in v1. GPU probe expansion is separate future work and should stay non-fatal.

